{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 44","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_44\">Problem 44</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 44\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A man born in the first half of the nineteenth century was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> years old in the year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />. He was born in: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cb17491c836c25e1f9e71a2d2b5a6fd0d62ee58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1849 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 1825 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 1812 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1836 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 1806$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"484\" height=\"17\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If a man born in the 19th century was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> years of in the year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, it implies that the year the man was born was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9d9bca007099d418648107c80d8bb3032467d4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x$\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />. So, if the man was born in the first half of the 19th century, it means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e5ef703eca019b3dccfd73fee1b8086ef79c82d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-x &lt; 1850$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />. Noticing that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6ecd5b299f4b943c32478ffad04a1e7999e0f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40^2 - 40 = 1560$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d38ad71a9bf3e835005066492fe76000672fe04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50^2-50 = 2450$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/0/570ae362d82e30bcd7f53b70a3b885e1e43e1a80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 &lt; x &lt; 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"94\" height=\"13\" />. We can guess values until we hit a solution.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/6/c36c434dbfbf1e4a6e3a0bf6cf0d2ec5ca4090b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$43^2-43 = 1806$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" />, so we see that the man had to have been <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/8/c38d81afc2fb4328ead7dde7d51221bdbac7bc53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> years old in the year <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/b/fcb7944c87e86da2190d4290fd84b5f7787b7345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1849=43^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"84\" height=\"15\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016224145\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 53/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2538/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:18084:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016224145 and revision id 115834. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}